<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70671" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηνεμ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stillness in the air, calm,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηνεμίης</span>”
				<i>in a calm,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.523
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαλήνη ἔπλετο νηνεμίη</span>
			there was a calm, <i>a ceasing of all winds</i> (the generic and
			specific words being in appos.), <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.392
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.169
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦν μὲν δὴ ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.218
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ αἰθρίης τε καὶ ν.</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				188
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέγα πνεῦμα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				77e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηνεμίῃ</span>”
				<i>in calm weather,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arat.
					1033
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.970
			</span></i>: in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηνεμίαι τε καὶ γαλῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					153c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν νηνεμίῃσι γαλήνης</span>
			Timo <i><span class="en">
				64
			</span></i>: c.gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. ἀνέμων</span> Epic.
			ap. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				197c
			</span></i> (s.v.l.).</div>
